haybarn-extension-ci-tools
==========================

This repository is a Haybarn fork of duckdb/extension-ci-tools, maintained by
Query Farm LLC.

It is NOT affiliated with, sponsored by, maintained by, or endorsed by the
DuckDB Foundation or DuckDB Labs.

Purpose
-------

Haybarn (an independent derived distribution of DuckDB) uses this fork as its
extension build harness. The fork lets Haybarn carry a small set of patches
that GitHub Actions' constraints around `secrets` make impossible to express
from the outside — chiefly: constructing a `VCPKG_BINARY_SOURCES` value that
contains a bearer token, so the build can read/write Haybarn's own R2-backed
vcpkg binary cache.

